  "content": "\n\n<h3>此模組增加了重生暮色森林首領的能力。（1.16.5 &ndash; 1.21.1）&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><br><strong>需要伺服器嗎？Kinetic Hosting 來幫您！使用代碼：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d624\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DIMAS</a></strong></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d624\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"font-size:16px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/916943/description_5a076ee1-7fb2-46ed-92c8-c340136e5aa5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"85\"></strong></a></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>運作方式：</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>擊敗首領（蛇妖、巫妖、九頭蛇、巨鬼、雪女）後，會在首領戰利品箱下方生成一個特殊方塊（基座）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>您需要將所擊敗首領的獎盃放置在此方塊上方。重要提示（適用於 1.16.5 &ndash; 1.19.2）：獎盃方塊必須朝向北方！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>接著，您需要按照圖示用特定方塊圍成一個圓圈</strong></p>\n<p><strong>然後只需對基座點擊右鍵即可！</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/735/627/image1.png\" alt=\"示意圖（例如巫妖重生）\" width=\"484\" height=\"457\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>用於重生首領的方塊可透過設定檔進行更改！</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>預設環狀方塊：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>蛇妖 - 鐵木方塊</p>\n<p>巫妖 - 金方塊</p>\n<p>九頭蛇 - 古神殘骸</p>\n<p>巨鬼 - <del>哭泣黑曜石（至 1.20.1 為止）</del> 騎士金屬方塊</p>\n<p>雪女 - <del>青金石方塊（至 1.20.1 為止）</del> 北極毛皮方塊</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/715/ds_loading.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"190\"><br>也歡迎加入我們的 Discord！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/xfBMY5RvwG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>",
